[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12725.349, "timestamp": "03:32:05", "text": "第三个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12728.309, "timestamp": "03:32:08", "text": "复制器正在运送途中。朋友们，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12732.63, "timestamp": "03:32:12", "text": "这里是加长狙击弹匣。二级。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12742.67, "timestamp": "03:32:22", "text": "诡异的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12748.95, "timestamp": "03:32:28", "text": "自从我开始玩游戏以来，现在就一直在玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12751.91, "timestamp": "03:32:31", "text": "是的。太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12753.67, "timestamp": "03:32:33", "text": "你完成活动了吗？骰子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12762.95, "timestamp": "03:32:42", "text": "我的意思是，我只是玩了一会儿而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12765.11, "timestamp": "03:32:45", "text": "天。等等，那是什么？有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12769.91, "timestamp": "03:32:49", "text": "入侵我的系统？我觉得你不，某人某人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12773.51, "timestamp": "03:32:53", "text": "有没有。我是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12776.45, "timestamp": "03:32:56", "text": "敌人在此？或许我应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12778.469, "timestamp": "03:32:58", "text": "[音乐]"}]